# expect-error: buf-set value type str does not match buf element type i32
# Compile-time type check on [buf-set]: assigning a str into an i32-elem
# buf is now a typer error instead of a runtime trap. Closes the
# soundness gap noted in BUFFER_DESIGN.md M4.4 ext follow-ups.
proc main [] [
  def [Buf 4 i32] xs
  buf-set $xs 0 "hello"
]
main
